{"id":"vi_rus","lemma":"vírus","pos":"noun","rank":1322,"glosses":["virus (DNA/RNA causing disease)","computer virus"],"ipa":"/ˈvi.ɾuʃ/","gender":"m","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2f/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Jessie_Edwin_Lawrence-v%C3%ADrus.wav","examples":[{"text":"Deve ser um vírus.","en":"It must be a virus.","words":[{"g":"should","l":"dever"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"É provavelmente um vírus.","en":"It's probably a virus.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"probably"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Não é um vírus.","en":"It isn't a virus.","words":[null,null,{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"isn't it"]]},{"text":"Parece que o computador foi infectado por um vírus.","en":"It seems that the computer was infected by a virus.","words":[{"g":"to seem","l":"parecer"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"computing"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to infect","l":"infectar"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Os vírus são muito menores que as bactérias.","en":"Viruses are much smaller than bacteria.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"very / a lot"},{"g":"minor, lesser","l":"menor"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"bacterium","l":"bactéria"}]}]}